1
00:00:00,315 --> 00:00:01,975
Good buddy Leonard?

2
00:00:04,486 --> 00:00:07,316
- What do you want?
- Hey, good buddy.

3
00:00:07,756 --> 00:00:09,886
So I was just talking to Amy...

4
00:00:10,091 --> 00:00:12,991
(Sheldon:)...and she made me realize
that this little dust-up...

5
00:00:13,194 --> 00:00:15,594
(Sheldon:)...between you and me
is much ado about nothing.

6
00:00:16,831 --> 00:00:19,821
- Is that so?
- Yes. All is forgiven, so come back home.

7
00:00:20,035 --> 00:00:23,475
(Sheldon:)I'll make you some soy hot chocolate
and then I'll tell you about...

8
00:00:23,672 --> 00:00:27,202
(Sheldon:)...our exciting new
devil-may-care bathroom policy.

9
00:00:31,146 --> 00:00:32,476
(Leonard:)Cut to the chase, Sheldon.

10
00:00:32,681 --> 00:00:35,211
Okay. Amy has decided
she wants to move in with me...

11
00:00:35,450 --> 00:00:38,910
(Sheldon:)...so I need you to come back home,
you lovable scamp.

12
00:00:40,188 --> 00:00:41,948
(Sheldon:)That's a lot of product.

13
00:00:42,824 --> 00:00:44,554
- Hey. What's going on?
- Get this.

14
00:00:44,793 --> 00:00:48,123
(Leonard:)Suddenly, Sheldon wants me back
because Amy wants to move in with him.

15
00:00:48,329 --> 00:00:50,299
(Penny:)Really? Interesting.

16
00:00:51,199 --> 00:00:53,359
(Leonard:)Well, too late, pal, I'm not going anywhere.

17
00:00:53,568 --> 00:00:56,798
(Leonard:)Penny and I are very happy living together.
Isn't that right?

18
00:00:57,005 --> 00:01:00,025
(Penny:)It's like the happiness
won't ever leave the apartment.

